============================================================
1. PROJECT VISION (READ CAREFULLY)
============================================================

AIRROUTE = Global AI Navigation Portal  
Target user = Light beginner users who want simple recommendations.  
The UX philosophy:
- Very simple. Very visual. Mobile-first.
- User should find a tool in < 3 seconds.
- Minimal text. Use cards, icons, badges.
- No clutter. No complex filtering early on.
- Trust-first: Verified links only.

Primary Service Flows:
1) Simple Mode (core of v0.5)
   - User chooses purpose → Airoute recommends tools.
   - Based on “task_category”, “best_for”, and ranking fields.

2) Tool Cards
   - Show image (later), name, desc_simple_en or desc_ko, badges, CTA button.

3) Tool Detail (v0.5 minimal)
   - Show all fields from tools table.
   - Show prompts list (optional, if using prompts table now).

4) Verified Link system
   - affiliate_url is primary link.
   - related_gear (Coupang/HW link) used later.

5) Senior Mode (Hyodo Mode)
   - Use desc_senior field (Korean simple explanation).
   - Not required for v0.5 but code structure must allow future expansion.


