6. API RULES
============================================================

/tools (list)
- GET only
- Return sorted tools:
  ORDER BY manual_rank ASC, rank_in_task ASC, created_at DESC

/tool/[id] (detail)
- GET only
- Return full fields + related prompts (optional)

Error Handling:
- Always check Supabase { data, error }
- Log error internally, return friendly message to UI

No mutation endpoints needed in v0.5.


